    This content is for informational purposes only and does not constitute legal, tax, or business advice. Confirm current excise tax rates, payment due dates, and Metrc fees with the Maine Office of Cannabis Policy and Maine Revenue Services before making operational decisions. The Maine Dispensary Guide is not a CPA firm.
  </div>
</article>
